	"crit_gyaradoze": {"stats": [["FIRST SEEN", "Pocket Critters Red and Blue"], ["SPECIES", "Pocket Critters"], ["TYPE", "Water (Magicarp) Water and Flying (Gyaradoze) Water and.."]], "hist": [["THE LOWDOWN", "Magicarp (Known as Koiking コイキング, Koikingu in Japan) and Gyaradoze are a pair of Pocket Critters species in the Pocket Critters franchise. Both Pocket Critters first appeared in Pocket Critters Red and Blue, going on to appear in almost every subsequent installments in the series."], ["ORIGIN", "Scrapped names in the game files of Pocket Critters Scarlet and Violet, named \"OKAKINGU\" and \"OKAGYARADOSU,\" indicated that alternate forms of Magicarp and Gyaradoze were considered for inclusion in the games, and were scrapped in favor of Toedscool and Toedscruel."], ["IN THE GAME", "Magicarp has appeared several times, most notably as the subject of a running gag in which a salesman attempts to trick Team Rockit into buying Magicarp in various guises, the first one being in Battle Aboard the St."], ["RECEPTION", "In Pocket Critters Sword and Shield, Magicarp was one of the most hated Pocket Critters due to in game NPCs and some players using Magicarp during the game's multiplayer raids."]], "year": 0},
